/* Short landscape viewports — a phone or small tablet held sideways.
   The touch-target floor is NOT reclaimed here to buy vertical space. This block used to
   override .dgo-sidebar__item to min-height:36px and shrink .dgo-iconbtn to 34px, against
   platform-authority.css's declared --dgo-control-target-min of 44px. It applied to 29
   navigation items and every icon button, on touch devices, which is the one context where
   the floor is load-bearing rather than decorative — and it was silent: the declaration
   above sets the token, and this overrode it 300 lines later.
